From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursor@example.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 17:20:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] libhailodsp: set stable ABI soname

The library currently embeds the full product version in SONAME, which makes
minor releases such as 1.12.1 and 1.12.2 appear ABI-incompatible even when
the interface is unchanged. Set a stable ABI soname so consumers link against
libhailodsp.so.1 while still installing the fully versioned real file.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [project-specific ABI policy]
---
 libhailodsp/libhailodsp/CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libhailodsp/libhailodsp/CMakeLists.txt b/libhailodsp/libhailodsp/CMakeLists.txt
index be37eb2..9a89ee1 100644
--- a/libhailodsp/libhailodsp/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/libhailodsp/libhailodsp/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -43,7 +43,7 @@ add_library(
   src/privacy_mask.cpp
   src/dsp_direct.cpp)
 
-set_target_properties(hailodsp PROPERTIES VERSION 1.12.1)
+set_target_properties(hailodsp PROPERTIES VERSION 1.12.1 SOVERSION 1)
 
 # cmake-lint: disable=E1120
 # https://github.com/cheshirekow/cmake_format/issues/218
-- 
2.43.0
